# Kabyle time-of-day words. Surfaces attested by native speaker
# athmanemokraoui (TigreGotico/chronologia#265, collaborator).
# Band boundaries fall back to chronologia's default day-period convention
# (Kabyle-specific clock boundaries were not provided).
# ṣṣbeḥ / taṣebḥit = morning; -a = proximal deictic ("this morning").
ṣṣbeḥ
taṣebḥit
ṣṣbeḥ-a
taṣebḥit-a
